# Releasing a pre-Space key while Space is in Meta held emits a Meta chord up.
0 in key KEY_A down
0 out key KEY_A down
50 in key KEY_SPACE down
250 in key KEY_B down
250 out key KEY_LEFTMETA down
250 out key KEY_B down
300 in key KEY_A up
300 out key KEY_A up
300 out key KEY_LEFTMETA up
350 in key KEY_B up
350 out key KEY_B up
350 out key KEY_LEFTMETA up
400 in key KEY_SPACE up
